===== config-server (NOT ATTEMPTED) =====
request-method: GET
request-url: (no URL: CONFIG_SERVER_URL was unset for this run)
observed-http-status: NOT-ATTEMPTED
not-attempted-because: CONFIG_SERVER_URL is unset, so no configuration-server address was supplied for this run.  The configuration server is one of the six services whose wire behaviour this migration preserves, and this probe is the only observation of it available to this script; supplying CONFIG_SERVER_URL closes the gap
note: the request above was NOT sent, so there is no response body to
  record.  The section is written rather than omitted because an absent
  section cannot be compared: a reader could not tell an unsent request
  from lost evidence.  Nothing here is a substitute for the observation
  that was not made, and no value below it is inferred from one.

